      "content": "I'm not sure what you mean by \"keeping the spirit of our little friends in mind.\" Can we just focus on the technical side? \n\nSpecifically, for step 1, how can I verify if it's an OOMKilled error versus just a process exiting? And for step 2, what specific kubectl commands should I use to see if the probes are actually the reason for the restarts?",
